# VEYRA configuration — optional overrides.
#
# The catalog endpoint and key are already compiled into the app, so a clone,
# `npm run dev`, the web build and the Android APK work with no .env file at
# all. Copy this file to .env.local only when you want a build to talk to a
# different deployment. A blank value falls back to the built-in default.
#
# Defaults (src/services/moviebox/client.js):
#   DEFAULT_API_BASE_URL=https://api.zstlab.cyou
#   DEFAULT_API_KEY=zst_...            (the working ZST Labs key)
#
# These values are PUBLIC. Vite inlines them into the web bundle and the
# Capacitor Android assets at build time, so anyone who has the app can read
# them. There is no backend in this project that could hold a secret, and VEYRA
# does not pretend otherwise. See README.md -> "About the API key".

# Catalog + media API base URL (ZST Labs MovieBox API).
#VITE_MOVIEBOX_API_BASE_URL=https://api.zstlab.cyou

# ZST Labs API key. Sent on every JSON request as the x-api-key header.
#VITE_ZST_API_KEY=replace-with-your-zst-labs-api-key
